{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1cfe97dd88f6b46841a348fda8672fe4ea21dd4a2c8a1c17595233b8126108d8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4c2e25358706f2031f2aefbd76e15963af01e3407f08e86b9af3c457eebfcd4",
      "text": "两颗心跳重叠交融",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9daadd94fa8e773b1006f5602a74433575807b2912c05373b9d6a471039db69c",
      "text": "来到试镜会场的丽，\n在等候室遇见了正发着呆的圭。\n两人毫无交谈地隔开坐着。然而，\n试镜开始后，听到了丽的歌声的\n圭突然站起身来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4c2e25358706f2031f2aefbd76e15963af01e3407f08e86b9af3c457eebfcd4",
      "text": "两颗心跳重叠交融",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07040148948158ee20d24c7db4ef47855c677f0883c4b54eb1257d81ef39b206",
      "text": "试镜当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dfb8b51dc1eedddec37f67992666c6dc6d8a00b1891a83f3f9d7c6a948d4a8e",
      "text": "……司机，就在这里让我下车吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cc6b13a7b5363e79fe747193fb913000f585ce2b4f84c5e13bf762e3476eb2f",
      "text": "（这一天终于来了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11ac0a7d23035048440e218f0cc1055daf00c0730a89826e794a100595c838a5",
      "text": "（……虽然我已经做了力所能及的准备）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b38ed54cb27f9f76fc400f0d790665d7fc6702ccc12a47e8ed023d22a2aa1e5",
      "text": "（但我真的适合当偶像吗？\n能通过试镜吗……？我不知道）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:796a5b25bb27f0bf309e793cd400808903e88786491820a3770e18629ca1c249",
      "text": "（但是……我不想就这样止步不前）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:048855337d855c80a0d650cdeff7b16fb4575af04d32f1d1918ceeddfafbf2cc",
      "text": "（我要把奉献了全部的自己的音乐……\n与音乐相伴的人生，重新夺回来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:308bd18fcba61bfbc24e51c4a81953a2ac9a081515942aed44784486a38855b9",
      "text": "是神乐丽先生对吧！\n好的，这样报到手续就办好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:248cf0baa210dec934ee502bbe871ebd703286594aa2fe5d0a18e4402e40a633",
      "text": "到时间之前，请在这里稍作等待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:355b00347956710a54adce2913b7225fe47cee356d917e1059b2d7a41906ef26",
      "text": "嗯，谢谢你。……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f18e80c53de22f982af32ab0f835121e86f7009cff09aa5b9c29b8bce347c8a",
      "text": "……哈啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:694496d5bb5072763f1125a2fa752060f3670b4925911d982f9291c22e23fb71",
      "text": "嗯……哈啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea6bb762cc6a81c12626fc8d1e22e1e41e4a463b619ab3e3f00da6b18741d5c7",
      "text": "（又打哈欠了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3acfabb43dcb1e57d32b72d93536ee6491750b18093ced3a84897ebfa9419ca8",
      "text": "（既然坐在这个房间里，\n应该也是参加试镜的人才对）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c301bdaf8ee8530b6501be51af9d46b893c57d7854d679c26b17376f0414d04",
      "text": "（……从刚才开始就完全没有紧张感。\n这个人到底是怎么回事……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8828840951a76c14a48f0ab3e73bbdf3426bcd611766552044eb209c579a5d18",
      "text": "让两位久等了！\n现在由我带两位前往试镜会场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb295a7fbeb0c9345c42050960071003ce84501557c7cd91c5bd6bf96ada8279",
      "text": "放松肩膀，好好加油哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99404465fdb7d54f07a6ff97e8e6c918acf7f0186b09e1cb18ae67afb2204569",
      "text": "嗯。拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5967cb757bf8b5941c3b99b2c6e1ba9cd248f58e6c575f7d920cec3f8212986",
      "text": "放松肩膀……吸——……呼——……好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dba6396ab88b9229b6ada00517aecb736240b70e5dab1c32088c6423c23082a",
      "text": "（……真是个一板一眼的孩子）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:051e343d8bc2b3315d6ed546835b98765557d148c67411d5323d8eb383b5c9ce",
      "text": "（还没开始就紧绷成那样，不觉得累吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c7dae00ce900d539a3fb69f65129ff5a5ba61e2ed9bd73926e238bb0ae7b6ff",
      "text": "首先请两位依次进行自我介绍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76607e30cbdbf76d256b7aac6eba7c09fc7dd7da164ca2f26bad2985b38edfbc",
      "text": "我是神乐丽，一名小提琴手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d4647af8093a5a37cf7580cdaa1380b9b3d7ec725f689d78a860352cab48fe3",
      "text": "自幼便与音乐作伴，\n与小提琴一同演奏音乐至今。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e1a0bb64f63f61d15f0e68bc650a05ad19770d55881e6697bafe391b3624fc6",
      "text": "无论在日本还是海外都有过演奏经验。\n只是，现在……正处于暂停活动的状态。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eff7e4d07497d4e0c8c6c46c6cec015bc71d917dcad55d7974c8cdfe116c98f4",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n那么接下来，请都筑圭先生开始。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f87ebc333efca50d29c9abce622ba973c17f6313e6f8b8cc559dfc48b13da44e",
      "text": "都筑圭。\n我……应该算是个作曲家吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8880423b1fcc4d95750cfc2e3297f4feb8d2b2de375904f6a08d666928081c10",
      "text": "写歌我很拿手。但是，\n除此以外的事情……也许连普通人的水平都达不到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbd6df82c22d1db088a3667a5fcf30646c7ee8209b1f1acde758596303c417bf",
      "text": "（作曲家，都筑圭……这个人就是他吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_c:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88ab7c69688c043fd6745d62abca88adb07ba359adca192a15fe70111495340e",
      "text": "（曾听说过世人称其为“金曲制造机”，\n对他的成就早有耳闻）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:614267348898af1eb7c1e9e79bf2f87b9c256d305a28825609be001f29b138cc",
      "text": "（这样的人，为什么会来参加\n偶像的试镜……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ce5803db03ba4b96fb4c4855df3f89db4c8ffd05b2e623ba8724c37cdba9782",
      "text": "那么，进入实操考核环节。\n神乐丽先生，能先让我们听听您的歌声吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9",
      "text": "明白了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3145bcb4f0b9f36e94434d328b9204d5888be5ada642a97aefff24e08918645",
      "text": "（既然要成为偶像，这自然是必不可少的审查。\n而且……我本来也喜欢唱歌）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9674097fd4d9b05a7a71933211f6c0860858b728ef60496b06889006ae06816",
      "text": "（虽然没像小提琴那样经常唱给别人听，\n难免有些紧张……但只要随心去唱……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8c7ef006a736b0822df9c4304cce69230ccc7cb8e40a51d0553f96e70bc207b",
      "text": "只要他一演奏，\n大把大把的钞票就滚滚而来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cc7595bf64ffd877db5de405fb9fa2cb53b66557be1101a2ac655a207578d74",
      "text": "（……不对）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a046a190ca869c7568494340380b2ce9522fd09b762214321605e1b175753b1",
      "text": "（这里不是那个剧场。\n这里的人也绝对和他们不一样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:695b75dea523e1aef78e409cba4fe5c0f3f9bfdda11d2cc3783b48de63e9061f",
      "text": "（他们不是因为“能赚钱”才叫我来的。\n……要相信他们）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7a4d1a674212d69c5c6135cdc78f402706fa7d8ca773027cefce8e0785b2063",
      "text": "（为了迈出这一步，要再一次相信周围的人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0848b123da503601c73e074a57af9f9b5c16147357119f0c4cff88b6843f548",
      "text": "（最重要的是……相信倾注了自己所有的音乐！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f5c26ab1f6d418195a09d8c73a00d8a8ced52e00cfd85a34287ba7396ab7c73",
      "text": "……那么，我开始唱了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7645045396822ced441138bf777fc97f02deb99a9b6202693b2f4ab4571f7471",
      "text": "……以上就是我的表现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de26753f556a6407dd61e322bac20a02c215b7c214f28eb919d97cdd9918111f",
      "text": "（非常动听的歌声……！\n仿佛能感受到他坦率的内心……嗯？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2e41c0d6f6b72c2b60a56c33f18f1435d47a84db948e2f79e930a4c6c1cf260",
      "text": "诶……？……哇！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc3b25f7e46d002f2a0bdaaad5a5a2b9ecf3c8a51dc76da9e4576754fc37ff2c",
      "text": "……你的歌声，真棒。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4292f5b17b7343de350a2c95718533ad6118a0ad84fcd3ef04d2ea2542f5e698",
      "text": "我想让你听听我的歌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5f99060219108230afa47343532491fa055e163381a93adec808556ef75b62d",
      "text": "我想……和你一起演奏！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c95a344f38fddcad8f40fc618b51a5cb705585938c5e86c3e5b3f496faa1acc3",
      "text": "…………诶……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da0665587e90908c3f98f66a90079adb963cab4330f8e9d376fede59ed155178",
      "text": "（……我本以为自己的人生，今后\n也只会一直通向无尽的黑暗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a730e6dc2e06341ac14af0967969d7412c62d8dbe79e95b3e40c1e8c3e8f8edd",
      "text": "（然而……啊啊。\n真没想到，竟然能遇上这样一道“光”！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a045e6bbb8d58f10a543433c9f5760e6537f765ed77212431f3efde98120d8f",
      "text": "（这个人到底是怎么回事……从刚才起就莫名其妙的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd906dd64c053fcfd7fd814a90b22a9440cd1d0299c0ac9e97be9c1744a51d6d",
      "text": "准备好了吗。……那么，我要开始了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_f:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ad32cdcab54403a7080701771e86800a33a7da45958f90e6a81b0fc4c1add0a",
      "text": "……这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf2c835abed348430c24566c1b60c72396de474013f70308573948123dd71fc",
      "text": "（……拥有极高的才华与非凡的技术。\n传入我耳中的音色，比任何言语都要雄辩地证明了这一点）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77a2cb15ef247f1285437c417b39fa590e04c6eaa9ff18410b07ffc05f7778a2",
      "text": "（而且……他是一个热爱音乐的人。\n我的胸膛、肌肤都在为之悸动、欢呼雀跃……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62ae0d2f1f89982676f8f89e389bc8a545a032b03cdea447535dbcadbbf1470e",
      "text": "（这个人是“同类”。\n和我一样，是为音乐而生的人……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3556cc69a0b0e0ef36ff20c97a9a65392a9b9743e91cb5b6a040e653651a971a",
      "text": "……呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7e8818715c2645a5d8fe4a67be0c658570467ead1ebdc80266cefe264355553",
      "text": "我的音乐传达给你了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edf741e3c81512d6cb25d248f7543a4e97ab16c9ad1a0c6d002e95e5cb4b8eac",
      "text": "……是的。非常动听的歌声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb1f2622c607e3407d8b50cb3258162a3f0beaafb92fc5ca48ad842fd2e0f021",
      "text": "（太美妙的歌声了，简直让人听得入迷……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_f:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:656e74783469a45720328795a0d77466ade1cc6b12d61c71ed36aa0ee7f0181a",
      "text": "……我都觉得自己好像到了天堂一样。\n真是太厉害的歌声了，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdbeaa57351dd82eeb48a07fb83e701fc0702eb366007733e0d6f1b1b55f4f58",
      "text": "……长时间的考核辛苦两位了！\n试镜到此结束。关于结果……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5eab186fc082cf8ad9c062983dc81f613b83c3508f7903dcb1396a44de9109e",
      "text": "圭先生、丽先生，两位都合格了。\n今后就请多多关照了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:330ce6088367e78e7360277af26e51cf54da4e9d0965c35b50ed14ce2efc76e4",
      "text": "这样啊，那太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f13cac81205e4c52b1da39700c70205a217eb856d987e0371bbe8fe32217b66e",
      "text": "……谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04a648e3ac58a7b976646a98c9195fa013ce7a496ed26b9bcd2a4d3a2af307ca",
      "text": "（合格了……从现在起，要作为偶像焕然一新地重新出发了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:787ba6c0785ff3bb704f2209ed4ba458a15e648434430fcb6a0516c301b6b14c",
      "text": "（面向世界，面向世人。\n我一定要再次把我的音乐传达出去……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79e93ed180184291cc4ef1b5cbc51658bf6e67f1b7b4c5e608eba0d989d3ff4c",
      "text": "还有，关于之前圭先生比较在意的\n偶像活动形式的问题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:444e19428b6768c2cb77a6b42e3120013bc11de7cefc385d5f702e15fd60c39f",
      "text": "如果两位愿意的话，要不要尝试组成组合呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a1f55d49748a443813dbf5403c8224d91db08ce93b2838f8710b936bb4ed39f",
      "text": "组合……？这、这个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:688afa2f1ebd1df50823b8fcbc67a04a2df3aa930b69cd526df7c898b3f9f4e2",
      "text": "……我倒是很希望能这样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a2a68ac945f5e20991b5dc881658197d47d57f041a148076b0d4e198c726233",
      "text": "就像我刚才说的那样……\n今后我也想一直在身边感受你所创造出的音色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_g:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188dba2365e9c949cfece9e76a569700983a4eb3527fedc870ae812f396d4432",
      "text": "因为想要活下去，我需要那份音色。\n……当然，这也需要你的意愿就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45869494c4b9c05b2ea454bcf4f508790633c500f7419ccdb63d3c80d0ddd8c2",
      "text": "（……如果是和这个人。如果是和这些人一起……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f1a25388251f7e0bf492f39e777e975dd53a0d8e8ea7873d052fa8e81ad4a1e",
      "text": "（我一定能够继续向前迈进。\n一定……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dee0860dedbe2138f2d3150e4b987eaa16c4fef689627d4cb99c2f144e0e7ed",
      "text": "我才要拜托您……如果不嫌弃我的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25e642eead247ac72858567d310cc591b4c1eda2e1a4a28cb5ee8eba7668255c",
      "text": "今后请多多指教了，都筑先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1142f343870283c4e8ef6783e106d32b2da2f37b966be5874838c4df98bd10c",
      "text": "我也是，丽先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000063:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000070:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dd622f9885a621e3b8cd6ce46363d06f6ff2a0913c6fd455db99df293fabb7d",
      "text": "神乐家宅邸",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f3bc12c57ed647f6da12e4c5166e4b56022fa26ad11fcc1b3c823206edb56f6",
      "text": "丽，你要出门吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da9244d24ecb46282525d2e08526d93ab5d6b16d1090edcddecc042006e5f4ab",
      "text": "是的，去315 Production。\n有关偶像出道的事项，要去听取说明。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:382edd2030c27670b787c8f99bbf42a91bb1ebcb497e0de30e041ab209c963f2",
      "text": "这样啊，路上小心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af3e2d6988f1af026a8be0cd9e25b60a187d678304b4d0e0021d6ae059582cba",
      "text": "好的，那我出门了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a250f19120dff576256832d044a40bf27e2cf5dadf60f51085050241abaea618",
      "text": "照那个样子看，已经没问题了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_h:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d7e27a46563a3f98fb5060ca642812db1f5c8eebebed176d49524224f642676",
      "text": "……差不多我也该，\n重新筹备自己的音乐会了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_i:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53ccafc12d17b8f72b190f6bfbd5487f964c60e33e82a9a4af9d95dbd4ec9870",
      "text": "圭。今天你不是要去事务所吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4facd3161ef95a4bddf86f0169d691683ef7643ad47d52c19ae6348da1c61592",
      "text": "啊……嗯。差不多该走了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ec1dac2a5b43599aa23a43eabdb0a5b5484f406af428b426944404b8953df6c",
      "text": "我记得你说过要结成组合对吧。\n是个什么样的搭档？年龄和你相近吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:baaa45a6dd3909b3c56ba3459ce1ed3f6f0bbc545cf7df8a781585bf6c3bbbcb",
      "text": "没有。年龄……差得挺多的吧。\n还有就是……整个人紧绷绷的，看着可能会觉得有点累。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_i:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0a57b46df76ffa1adb0d3764b5246970e7b23cb8e67f836176ddda779ea13a3",
      "text": "……不过，他的歌声非常美妙哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2419149cef49caa4a3bf989f6b4cdef9d80f862734f3cb0a24d0eb88a124990e",
      "text": "美妙到让我这颗心跳，都想要再次跳动起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abb6874249194f45d2d1aaf92fff1700373f08f6686a41556ab74365df5eeba7",
      "text": "……这样啊。那太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74729077e23599aca5afb441968d4b451a83faf94dfda94ca1f7f190124bda2c",
      "text": "再次恭喜你合格。\n作为朋友，我会为你崭新的人生加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da76ef06f74064ee870673eacede6df2109ddd78db630f658d5c095c8da21ae5",
      "text": "……真是个美好的早晨。……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a097a4ca7f71ea7aec73fc3259afe5068f26d8b8c2cbb018cb6abcef782ac98a",
      "text": "呼……呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bd7224616495fb1efffdb5c8afa6a6844bf9b4f311f326473b7449169a4c460",
      "text": "……辛苦了，都筑先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2bed531cf4b69c49837a2ec79e53b5fc3b7eee338ee882bed49d2415f861a5b",
      "text": "嗯……早上好，丽先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6fc3fcd3f5c959593b908fb81754d2c83afc2a61be6ab752c979c7382d86724",
      "text": "您难道是在这种地方睡着了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:323ec5610ce46c89eed7c330d07ed22cafd86690dd6873537dc9cb72f38aab29",
      "text": "嗯。在去事务所的路上……\n因为今天天气很好，不知不觉就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e878f51595f56caee08ac788d60b9963f079db20ca3c08a058cf6d043886954d",
      "text": "唉……但是，请看一下表。\n时间已经不早了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64b27e51c59725938777887780a4de69f95ef18cc64ad7c7cf554772ebc96da9",
      "text": "我们的事情是一样的。\n迟到了可不好，一起去事务所吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e831d99a5bfe92b75ad731d91111d9533892e3656039964aa040e091b685149d",
      "text": "哈啊……也是呢，一起走吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ddb3dc61363d05497bf832e492642b5db2e375f102b13bd50872c2ca506c0ac",
      "text": "（知道了时间也完全没有着急的样子。\n果然这个人让人完全无法理解）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_j:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb723ab8f226009aef2d7db01bf7112feb6cb2e49c5442b5056031d2e09b0ec6",
      "text": "（还是一如既往的一板一眼呢。\n光看着，我这边的肩膀都快酸了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_003alt_04_1_1_003_04:1_1_003_04_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
